...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
agent: Surelock Homes { class: ours }
openrouter: OpenRouter { class: ext }
sos: IL SOS { class: ext }

openrouter -> agent: tool_call check_business_registration(name)
agent -> sos: GET entitysearch
sos -> agent: HTTP 403 또는 등록정보
agent -> openrouter: tool 결과: status
openrouter -> agent: 조사 서술 텍스트(스트리밍)
agent -> ui: chunk마다 markdown 누적
ui -> user: 실시간 서술 렌더링
